{"ch": 104, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "وَیۡلٌ لِّکُلِّ ہُمَزَۃٍ لُّمَزَۃِ  ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "Woe to every backbiter, slanderer,", "w": ["woe", "to every", "backbiter", "slanderer", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "ۣالَّذِیۡ جَمَعَ مَالًا وَّعَدَّدَہٗ ۙ﴿۳﴾", "en": "Who amasses wealth and counts it time after time.", "w": ["who", "amasses", "wealth", "and counts it time after time", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "یَحۡسَبُ اَنَّ مَالَہٗۤ اَخۡلَدَہٗ ۚ﴿۴﴾", "en": "He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.", "w": ["he thinks", "that", "his wealth", "will make him immortal", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "کَلَّا لَیُنۡۢبَذَنَّ فِی الۡحُطَمَۃِ ۫﴿ۖ۵﴾", "en": "[✲]Nay! he shall surely be cast into the crushing punishment.", "w": ["nay!", "he shall surely be cast", "into", "the crushing punishment", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "وَمَاۤ اَدۡرٰٮکَ مَا الۡحُطَمَۃُ ؕ﴿۶﴾", "en": "[✲]And what should make thee know what the crushing punishment is?", "w": ["and what", "should make thee know", "what", "the crushing punishment is", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "نَارُ اللّٰہِ الۡمُوۡقَدَۃُ ۙ﴿۷﴾", "en": "<i>It is</i> Allah’s kindled fire,", "w": ["<i>it is</i> fire", "Allah’s", "kindled", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "الَّتِیۡ تَطَّلِعُ عَلَی الۡاَفۡـِٕدَۃِ ؕ﴿۸﴾", "en": "[✲]Which rises over the hearts.", "w": ["which", "rises", "over", "the hearts", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "اِنَّہَا عَلَیۡہِمۡ مُّؤۡصَدَۃٌ ۙ﴿۹﴾", "en": "[✲]It will be closed in on them", "w": ["it", "on them", "will be closed in", ""]}, {"n": 10, "ar": "فِیۡ عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَۃٍ ﴿٪۱۰﴾", "en": "[✲]In <i>the form of</i> extended columns.", "w": ["in", "<i>the form of</i> columns", "extended", ""]}]}